WEBVTT

NOTE
The D-District Prison in the desert — drill-leg and gangways.
Duration: approximately 30 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
High angles look down the prison's giant drill-leg.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.900
Narrow suspended gangways stretch over the rippled desert sand.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.480
The structure shifts; the clip fades to darkness.
